      "writtenOn": "2026-10-12T21:01:26Z",
      "side": 1,
      "message": "`set_state()` assigns `ctx-\u003eprevious \u003d ctx-\u003ecurrent` right before calling the entry functions. Because `ctx.current` is NULL on initial startup when `tc_state_init()` calls `restart_tc_sm()`, `ctx.previous` gets overwritten with NULL before `tc_unattached_snk_entry()` runs.\n\nThis change aligns `get_last_state_tc` to match `get_state_tc`.",
      "parentUuid": "e37bb919_3157cdb9",
      "revId": "d17e7f95f390ef91a87088544044bb389d668b39",
