      "writtenOn": "2026-10-19T17:33:47Z",
      "side": 1,
      "message": "Done. Added `tc_state_is_attached()` (also used in `pd_is_connected()`) and used `tc_state_is_attached(get_last_state_tc(port))` in `tc_unattached_snk_entry()`, `tc_unattached_src_entry()`, and `tc_try_wait_snk_entry()` (to cover the `Attached.SRC -\u003e TryWait.SNK -\u003e Unattached.SNK` detach path when `Try.SRC` is enabled).",
      "parentUuid": "235b20ee_e7e6d778",
      "isAi": true,
      "revId": "d17e7f95f390ef91a87088544044bb389d668b39",
      "serverId": "3ce6091f-6c88-37e8-8c75-72f92ae8dfba"
    },
    {
      "unresolved": true,
      "key": {
        "uuid": "e629b28e_adb82c09",
        "filename": "common/usbc/usb_tc_drp_acc_trysrc_sm.c",
        "patchSetId": 9
      },
      "lineNbr": 2177,
      "author": {
        "id": 1390635
      },
      "writtenOn": "2026-10-19T17:33:47Z",
      "side": 1,
      "message": "get_last_state_tc(port) only tracks the immediate previous state, which isn\u0027t sufficient when detaching from TC_ATTACHED_SRC: \n* TC_ATTACHED_SRC -\u003e TC_TRY_WAIT_SNK\n* If no partner attaches, TC_TRY_WAIT_SNK -\u003e TC_UNATTACHED_SNK (so get_last_state_tc(port) is TC_TRY_WAIT_SNK)\n* TC_TRY_WAIT_SNK -\u003e TC_UNATTACHED_SNK is also reached without ever attaching via TC_ATTACH_WAIT_SNK -\u003e TC_TRY_SRC -\u003e TC_TRY_WAIT_SNK -\u003e TC_UNATTACHED_SNK",
      "parentUuid": "235b20ee_e7e6d778",
      "revId": "d17e7f95f390ef91a87088544044bb389d668b39",
      "serverId": "3ce6091f-6c88-37e8-8c75-72f92ae8dfba"
